  "content": "<h1>DarkCap</h1>\n<p><strong>模組說明</strong></p>\n<p>將經驗值(XP)上限設定為1000，不多也不少。</p>\n<p><em>支援伺服器端安裝。您只需在伺服器上安裝此模組，客戶端無需安裝。</em></p>\n<p>由製作<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>的同團隊開發（若想獲得完整RPG體驗，請下載<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG模組包</a>享受任務與RPG玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>(這些功能將進一步增強您的原版遊戲體驗)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這個簡單的模組會檢查玩家經驗值，防止超過1000上限。對於包含多種獲取經驗途徑的伺服器或模組包特別有用，能避免玩家累積數千/數百萬經驗值的情況。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/505/160/crazy-xp-amounts.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"130\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;當經驗值超過1000時，系統會自動重置為1000。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/504/929/screenshot-2022-10-07-010438.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"323\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與朋友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折優惠！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
